sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant L as Library
  participant I as LibraryIterator
  C->>L: createIterator()
  L-->>C: iterator (position 0)
  loop while hasNext()
    C->>I: hasNext()
    I-->>C: true
    C->>I: next()
    I-->>C: book at position, then position + 1
  end
  C->>I: hasNext()
  I-->>C: false (end)
